* NMOS cascode whose cascode rail is generated by a stacked diode branch
* The paired ideal-bias experiment is cascode_stack in L2_stages: same
* measurement, same devices, but there every gate rail is an ideal source.
* Comparing the two isolates bias generation from cascode operation.
<MODEL_SETUP>
Vdd vdd 0 <VDD>
Vbn bn 0 <BODY_N>
Irefn vdd nc <IBIAS>
<N_PREFIX>n_casdio nc nc nb bn <N_DEVICE>
<N_PREFIX>n_lodio nb nb 0 bn <N_DEVICE>
Voutn dn 0 <CASCODE_OUT>
<N_PREFIX>n_lo nx nb 0 bn <N_DEVICE>
<N_PREFIX>n_hi dn nc nx bn <N_DEVICE>
<OUTPUT_LOAD>
.temp <TEMP>
<ANALYSIS>
.end
